                            <comment id="15497524" author="vkulichenko" created="Fri, 16 Sep 2016 22:00:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added special handling to &lt;tt&gt;BinaryObject.toString()&lt;/tt&gt; method for object arrays, collections and maps.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15509387" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 21 Sep 2016 09:38:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reopened as another stack overflow was found there when &lt;tt&gt;IgniteUuid&lt;/tt&gt; which is &lt;tt&gt;Iterable&lt;/tt&gt; is in the object.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15511246" author="vkulichenko" created="Wed, 21 Sep 2016 21:31:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fix for &lt;tt&gt;IgniteUuid&lt;/tt&gt; looks good to me. In case other similar cases exist, let&apos;s address them separately.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
